blue must you add for an even chance of red?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 3, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m4u04s1p06", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Picking a vowel from A, E, I, O, U:", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "impossible", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "unlikely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "even chance", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "likely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "certain", "ok": true, "fb": ""}], "fixed": true}, {"id": "m4u04s1p07", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A baby is born on a Monday:", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "impossible", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "unlikely", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "even chance", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "likely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "certain", "ok": false, "fb": ""}], "fixed": true}, {"id": "m4u04s1p08", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Order from least likely: (a) coin heads (b) dice 6 (c) dice less than 7", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "b, a, c", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "a, b, c", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}], "adv": [{"id": "m4u04s1a01", "type": "explain", "prompt": "* Advanced. Design a bag of 10 counters where red is likely, blue is unlikely and green is impossible.", "diff": "H", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "rubric": [{"pt": "red more than 5, blue fewer, no green", "kw": ["\\b(6|7|8|9)\\b"]}], "need": 1, "model": "e.g. 8 red and 2 blue, no green.", "hint": "", "reason": "e.g. 8 red and 2 blue, no green."}, {"id": "m4u04s1a02", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "* Advanced. Two coins are flipped. Both heads is…", "diff": "VH", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "unlikely", "ok": true, "fb": "1 of 4 ways."}, {"t": "even chance", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m4u04s1a03", "type": "num", "prompt": "* Advanced. A bag has 4 red and 2 blue. How many blue to add so red and blue have an even chance?", "diff": "H", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 2, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}], "more": [{"id": "m4u04s1m01", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "The sun will set today:", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "impossible", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "unlikely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "even chance", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "likely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "certain", "ok": true, "fb": ""}], "fixed": true}, {"id": "m4u04s1m02", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A cat will drive a bus:", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "impossible", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "unlikely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "even chance", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "likely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "certain", "ok": false, "fb": ""}], "fixed": true}, {"id": "m4u04s1m03", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Coin heads:", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "impossible", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "unlikely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "even chance", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "likely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "certain", "ok": false, "fb": ""}], "fixed": true}, {"id": "m4u04s1m04", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Bag of 1 red and 9 blue. Red:", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "impossible", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "unlikely", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "even chance", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "likely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "certain", "ok": false, "fb": ""}], "fixed": true}, {"id": "m4u04s1m05", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Bag of 1 red and 9 blue. Blue:", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "impossible", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "unlikely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "even chance", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "likely", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "certain", "ok": false, "fb": ""}], "fixed": true}, {"id": "m4u04s1m06", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Bag of only blue. Blue:", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "impossible", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "unlikely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "even chance", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "likely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "certain", "ok": true, "fb": ""}], "fixed": true}], "notes": "v4", "pdf": [{"book": "c4u04", "p0": 2, "p1": 5, "label": "pages 2–5", "title": "Lesson 4.1 notes · Likelihood", "note": "The whole lesson as a document you can print, then Practice on paper with answers at the back.", "look": []}]}, {"id": "4.2", "title": "Chance experiments", "objs": ["O2"], "lesson": [{"k": "hook", "t": "Dice race", "p": ["In a board game you need a **6** to start. Your friend says 'six is the hardest number to roll'.", "Is that true? How could you test it? Decide before you read on."]}, {"k": "recall", "t": "Tally marks", "p": ["𝍸 = 5."], "qq": {"id": "m4u04s2t01", "type": "num", "prompt": "𝍸 ||| = ?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 8, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "8."}}, {"k": "idea", "t": "Chance experiments", "p": ["In a **chance experiment** we try something many times and record what happens with **tally marks**."], "table": {"head": ["Dice number", "Tally", "Total"], "rows": [["1", "𝍸 𝍸", "10"], ["2", "𝍸 𝍸 |", "11"], ["3", "𝍸 ||||", "9"], ["4", "𝍸 𝍸", "10"], ["5", "𝍸 𝍸 ||", "12"], ["6", "𝍸 ||||", "8"]]}, "p2": ["60 rolls: each number came up about 10 times. The numbers are **equally likely** – 6 is not harder."]}, {"k": "idea", "t": "Equally likely", "p": ["On a fair dice each number has the **same chance**. Results are never exactly equal, but with many tries they are **close**.", "Outcomes are **not** equally likely if, for example, a spinner has a bigger section of one colour."]}, {"k": "try", "t": "Total", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m4u04s2t02", "type": "num", "prompt": "How many rolls altogether? (10 + 11 + 9 + 10 + 12 + 8)", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 60, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "60."}}, {"k": "method", "t": "How do I carry out a chance experiment?", "p": ["Step 1: Decide what to test and how many tries.", "Step 2: Record each result with a tally.", "Step 3: Count the totals.", "Step 4: Compare: are the outcomes about the same (equally likely) or not?"]}, {"k": "example", "t": "Coin", "p": [], "q": "20 flips: heads 11, tails 9.", "steps": [["close to 10 each", ""]], "a": "equally likely"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Spinner", "p": [], "q": "A spinner: red 31, blue 9 in 40 spins.", "steps": [["red much more often", ""]], "a": "not equally likely (red is bigger)"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Most", "p": [], "q": "Which number came up most in the dice table?", "steps": [["12 is the biggest total", ""]], "a": "5"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Fewer tries", "p": [], "q": "6 rolls: 1, 1, 3, 1, 4, 2.", "steps": [["too few to decide", ""]], "a": "do more tries"}, {"k": "try", "t": "Coin", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m4u04s2t03", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "50 flips: heads 26, tails 24. The outcomes are…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "equally likely", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "not equally likely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}}, {"k": "error", "t": "Deciding from a few tries", "p": ["Find the first wrong line."], "q": "4 dice rolls: no 6.", "lines": ["So 6 is the hardest number to roll."], "bad": 0, "why": "4 tries is far too few. Do many more – each number has the same chance.", "fix": [["do more tries", ""]], "id": "m4u04s2t04"}, {"k": "mistake", "t": "Deciding from a few tries", "p": ["More tries give a fairer picture."]}, {"k": "tip", "t": "Real life", "p": ["Game makers test dice and spinners thousands of times to make sure games are fair."]}, {"k": "summary", "t": "What to remember", "p": ["Experiment: try many times, record with tallies.", "Equally likely = same chance; results close.", "Bigger sections → more likely.", "Few tries can mislead."]}], "video": {"src": null, "offset": 0, "dur": 660, "range": ""}, "stops": [{"id": "4.2-k1", "t": 1, "after": 0, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m4u04s2k01", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Before you read on: how could you test it?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "roll a dice many times and record", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "roll once", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}}, {"id": "4.2-k2", "t": 2, "after": 4, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m4u04s2k02", "type": "num", "prompt": "How many times did 6 come up?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 8, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}}, {"id": "4.2-k3", "t": 3, "after": 9, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m4u04s2k03", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Red 31, blue 9 – equally likely?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "no", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "yes", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}}, {"id": "4.2-k4", "t": 4, "after": 14, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m4u04s2k04", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Quick check: 4 rolls, no 6. Is 6 harder to roll?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "can't tell – do more", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "yes", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}}], "captions": [], "chapters": [[0, 300]], "req": [{"id": "m4u04s2r01", "type": "num", "prompt": "𝍸 𝍸 || = ?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 12, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m4u04s2r02", "type": "num", "prompt": "Tally totals 7, 8, 5. Total tries?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 20, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m4u04s2r03", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "On a fair dice, are 1 and 6 equally likely?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "yes", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "no", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m4u04s2r04", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Heads 15, tails 15. Equally likely?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "yes", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "no", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m4u04s2r05", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Spinner half red, half blue. Equally likely?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "yes", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "no", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m4u04s2r06", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Spinner ¾ red, ¼ blue. Equally likely?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "no", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "yes", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m4u04s2r07", "type": "num", "prompt": "30 coin flips. About how many heads?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 15, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m4u04s2r08", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "To record results we use…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "tally marks", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "a ruler", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}], "prac": [{"id": "m4u04s2p01", "type": "num", "prompt": "60 dice rolls. About how many 3s?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 10, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m4u04s2p02", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Spinner: green 48, yellow 12. Which section is bigger?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "green", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "yellow", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m4u04s2p03", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "100 coin flips: heads 52. Is the coin fair?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "probably", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "no", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m4u04s2p04", "type": "explain", "prompt": "Explain why results are not exactly the same even with a fair dice.", "diff": "H", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "rubric": [{"pt": "chance / random", "kw": ["chance|random|luck|vary|differ"]}], "need": 1, "model": "Each roll is down to chance, so results vary a little; with many rolls they get close.", "hint": "", "reason": "Each roll is down to chance, so results vary a little; with many rolls they get close."}, {"id": "m4u04s2p05", "type": "num", "prompt": "A bag has 1 red and 1 blue counter (put back each time). 40 picks. About how many red?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 20, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m4u04s2p06", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Results: 1→9, 2→10, 3→2, 4→11, 5→10, 6→18. Something odd?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "yes – 3 low, 6 high", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "no", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m4u04s2p07", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Better test?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "100 tries", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "5 tries", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m4u04s2p08", "type": "num", "prompt": "Heads 23 in 50 flips. Tails?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 27, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}], "adv": [{"id": "m4u04s2a01", "type": "explain", "prompt": "* Advanced. A spinner is split into red, blue and green. After 90 spins: red 60, blue 15, green 15. Describe what the spinner might look like.", "diff": "VH", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "rubric": [{"pt": "red bigger / two-thirds", "kw": ["red.*(big|half|most|two|2/3)|big.*red"]}], "need": 1, "model": "Red takes about two-thirds; blue and green share the rest equally.", "hint": "", "reason": "Red takes about two-thirds; blue and green share the rest equally."}, {"id": "m4u04s2a02", "type": "num", "prompt": "* Advanced. A fair 1–6 dice rolled 120 times. About how many odd numbers?", "diff": "H", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 60, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m4u04s2a03", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "* Advanced. Two dice are added. Is a total of 7 as likely as a total of 2?", "diff": "VH", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "no – 7 is more likely", "ok": true, "fb": "More ways to make 7."}, {"t": "yes", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}], "more": [{"id": "m4u04s2m01", "type": "num", "prompt": "𝍸 = ?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 5, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m4u04s2m02", "type": "num", "prompt": "𝍸 | = ?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 6, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m4u04s2m03", "type": "num", "prompt": "10 coin flips. About how many heads?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 5, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m4u04s2m04", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Fair dice numbers are…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "equally likely", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "not equally likely", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m4u04s2m05", "type": "num", "prompt": "Totals 4 and 6. Altogether?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 10, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m4u04s2m06", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "More tries give…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "a fairer picture", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "exact results", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}], "notes": "v4", "pdf": [{"book": "c4u04", "p0": 6, "p1": 9, "label": "pages 6–9", "title": "Lesson 4.2 notes · Chance experiments", "note": "The whole lesson as a document you can print, then Practice on paper with answers at the back.", "look": []}]}], "segments": {"O1": ["4.1", 0, 300, "Likelihood"], "O2": ["4.2", 0, 300, "Chance experiments"]}, "sources": [], "tests": {"A": [{"id": "m4u04v3Aq01", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A bag has 4 red and 4 green balls. How likely is it to pick green?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "pts": 1, "sec": "A · Fluency", "options": [{"t": "impossible"}, {"t": "likely"}, {"t": "even chance"}, {"t": "unlikely"}]}, {"id": "m4u04v3Aq02", "type": "num", "prompt": "How many more times did blue come up than green?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Data", "pts": 1, "data": {"head": ["Colour", "red", "blue", "green"], "rows": [["Times", "8", "9", "2"]]}, "sec": "A · Fluency", "unit": "times", "units": ["times"]}, {"id": "m4u04v3Aq03", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A jar has 4 lemon and 9 orange sweets. How likely is it to pick a lemon sweet?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "pts": 1, "sec": "A · Fluency", "options": [{"t": "likely"}, {"t": "unlikely"}, {"t": "even chance"}, {"t": "impossible"}]}, {"id": "m4u04v3Aq04", "type": "num", "prompt": "A spinner landed on red 9 times, blue 2 times and green 10 times. How many spins in total?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "pts": 1, "sec": "A · Fluency", "unit": "spins", "units": ["spins"]}, {"id": "m4u04v3Aq05", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A box has 6 pencils and nothing else. How likely is it to pick a crayon?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "pts": 1, "sec": "A · Fluency", "options": [{"t": "even chance"}, {"t": "unlikely"}, {"t": "impossible"}, {"t": "likely"}]}, {"id": "m4u04v3Aq06", "type": "short", "prompt": "The bar chart shows the results of spinning a spinner. Which colour came up most?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Figure", "pts": 1, "fig": {"kind": "barchart", "labels": ["red", "blue", "green", "yellow"], "values": [6, 9, 4, 5], "ymax": 14, "step": 2, "ylabel": "Times"}, "sec": "A · Fluency"}, {"id": "m4u04v3Aq07", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A bag has 4 red and 6 blue counters. How likely is picking red?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "pts": 1, "sec": "A · Fluency", "options": [{"t": "unlikely"}, {"t": "likely"}, {"t": "even chance"}, {"t": "impossible"}]}, {"id": "m4u04v3Aq08", "type": "num", "prompt": "The table shows spinner results. How many times did it land on blue?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Data", "pts": 1, "data": {"head": ["Colour", "red", "blue", "green"], "rows": [["Times", "15", "8", "5"]]}, "sec": "A · Fluency", "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "bare": true}, {"id": "m4u04v3Aq09", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In a class of 16, 3 children have a pet. One child is picked at random. How likely is it they have a pet?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "pts": 1, "sec": "B · Methods", "options": [{"t": "even chance"}, {"t": "unlikely"}, {"t": "impossible"}, {"t": "likely"}]}, {"id": "m4u04v3Aq10", "type": "num", "prompt": "Group A recorded 10 heads and group B recorded 12 heads. How many heads altogether?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "pts": 1, "sec": "B · Methods", "unit": "heads